        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wakamba ne, Unvue biebe dî dia Yehowa. Yehowa udi wamba ne, Makelela ha diba edi mene nebahane tshihiminu tshia bukula bubotesha ku nshekele umue, ne bihiminu bia bukula bua orge bibidi ku nshekele umue ku tshibi tshia ku Samalea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe kapitene kakadi mukelenge weyemena ku tshianza tshiandi kakambila muntu wa Nzambi ne, Biatunzuluila Yehowa bibi bia mu diulu, bualu ebu nebuikale munyi? Yeye wakamuambila ne. Mesu ebe neamone bualu ebu, kadi kuena uhidia nansha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena nsudi banai bakadi bashikame ku tshibi tshia musoko; bakambilangana ne, Tudi bashikame kunoko tô ne hatuafua bua tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bituanua ne, Netubuele mu musoko, ka tshiole tshidiku, netufuileku; bituashikama kunoko tshianana, netufuile kabidi. Nunku tuye bietu kudi masalayi a Bena Sulia; biatusungilabo, netuikale ne muoyo; biatushihabo, netufue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamba diba kubuela, bakajuka, bakaya ku tshitudilu tshia Bena Sulia; hakafikabo ku mpenge wa tshitudilu tshia Bena Sulia, kabakasanganaku muinu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Yehowa wakuosha Bena Sulia tshiona tshia makalu ne tubalu ne tshia masalayi a bungi; bakambilangana ne, Monai, mukelenge wa Isalele wakafuta bakelenge ba Bena Hiti ne bakelenge ba Ejipitu bua kuluanganabo nʼetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku ha kajimbuʼa buenyi, bakajuka, bakanyema, bakashiya ntenta yabo ne tubalu tuabo ne nyama yabo ya mpunda ne tshitudilu tshiabo bu muakaditshi, bakanyema bua kuhandishabo mioyo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafika bena nsudi aba ku mpenge wa tshitudilu, bakabuela mu ntenta, bakadia, bakanua, bakafumaku ne tshiamu tshia argent ne tshia or ne bilulu, bakaya, bakabisokoka; bakahingana, bakabuela mu ntenta mukuabo, bakangata bintu, bakabisokoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bakamusangana ne, Katuena tuenza bimpe, bualu bua edi ndituku dia lumu luimpe, ne tuetu tudi bahuwe. Bituajingakana tô ne hatshiabu, dikenga neditukuate; nunku tuye bietu kumanyisha ba mu nsubu wa mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakahingana, bakabikila balami ba tshibi tshia musoko, bakabambila ne, Tuetu biakafuma ku tshitudilu tshia Bena Sulia, kabakatangila muntu, katuakunvua dî dia muntu; kadi tuhalu ne nyama ya mpunda biakadi bisuikibue, ne ntenta yakashala hatuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balami ba tshibi bakela dî, bakambila ba mu nsubu wa mukelenge lumu alu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakabika butuku, wakambila bantu bandi ne, Nennuambile bu muakatuenzela Bena Sulia. Badi bamanye ne, Tuetu tudi ne nzala; nunku bakumuka mu tshitudilu tshiabo, bakasokoma mu mpata, bamba ne, Haluhukabo, netubakuate ne muoyo, netubuele mu musoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umue wa bantu bandi wakamuambila ne, Ndi nkusengelela ne, Witabushe bua bangate tubalu tutanu tudi tushala mu musoko, bualu bua tubalu tudi bu tshisumbu tshia Bena Isalele tshidi tshishala, ludi bu tshisumbu tshia Bena Isalele tshiakadia; tubatume, batangile bualu ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakangata makalu abidi ne tubalu, mukelenge wakatuma bantu ku nyima kua Bena Sulia ne, Yai, nutangile bualu ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabihata tô ne ku Yadene; monai, nshila wakadi mûle tente ne bilulu ne bintu biakimasha Bena Sulia mu lubilu luabo. Bantu hakahingana, bakamanyisha mukelenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bakaluhuka, bakahaula tshitudilu tshia Bena Sulia. Nunku bakahana tshihiminu tshia bukula bubotesha ku nshekele umue, ne bihiminu bia bukula bua orge bibidi ku nshekele umue bu muakadi dî dia Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakasungula kapitene kakadiye weyemena ku tshianza tshiandi bua kulameye tshibi tshia musoko; bantu bakamudiata mu makasa ku tshibi; wakafua bu muakadi dî dia muntu wa Nzambi diakamuambileye hakahueka mukelenge kudiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bakambila muntu wa Nzambi mukelenge ne, Makelela ba diba edi nebahane bihiminu bia bukula bua orge bibidi ku nshekele umue ne tshihiminu tshia bukula bubotesha ku nshekele umue ku tshibi tshia Samalea; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kapitene kakambila muntu wa Nzambi ne, Biatunzuluila Yehowa bibi bia mu diulu bualu ebu nebuikale munyi? Elisha wakamuitaba ne, Mesu ebe neamone bualu ebu, kadi wewe kuena uhidia nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu buakalua nunku kudiye; bantu bakamudiata mu makasa ku tshibi, yeye wakafua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
